      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ROCKIN BULL (1) added to his strong form when worked to the lead from a wide barrier and stuck on well for second at Menangle last start. Overcame a back row draw to win the last time he raced here and can take full advantage of the ace draw. LOCHINVAR JAG (9) made it four wins from his last six appearances when he raced parked but dug deep to get home narrowly at Penrith last time. Draws on the back row here but comes back in grade so could be tough to beat with even luck. HAPPY TOO YA (10) is another presented with a new challenge courtesy of a second line draw but he is hard to knock after putting together a string of top-two results including a win at this circuit and distance two back. METALLICA MAN (6) draws wide but is in the mix after turning in a good effort last week to come from the back row for second at this venue.",
